---
// A pharmacy label: the smallest type on the page, and the one that most needs to be read.
---

<figure class="label-rx" aria-label="Pharmacy label">
  <div class="top">
    <p class="shop">Sölvbergs apotek</p>
    <p class="tel">Storgatan 14, 0123-456 78</p>
  </div>
  <p class="who">Freja Lindqvist</p>
  <p class="drug">Ibuprofen 400 mg tabletter</p>
  <p class="dose">1 tablett 3 gånger dagligen vid behov. Högst 6 tabletter per dygn. Tas med vatten, gärna i samband med måltid.</p>
  <div class="warn">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 18" width="20" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 1.5 18.5 16.5h-17Z" /></svg>
    <p>Kan påverka förmågan att framföra fordon.</p>
  </div>
  <dl class="foot">
    <div><dt>Förskr.</dt><dd>Nils Åberg</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Rp</dt><dd>4417-22</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Antal</dt><dd>100 st</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Exp.</dt><dd>2026-11-18</dd></div>
  </dl>
</figure>

<style>
  .label-rx {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #17191c;
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem 0.8rem;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08), 0 6px 18px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    align-content: start;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #17191c;
  }
  .shop {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .tel {
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    color: #4d535a;
  }
  .who {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .drug {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .dose {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .warn {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .warn svg {
    flex: none;
    fill: #fff;
    stroke: #c2381c;
    stroke-width: 2.2;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .foot {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.15rem 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    padding-top: 0.35rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #d0d5da;
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .foot div {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.3em;
  }
  .foot dt {
    color: #4d535a;
  }
</style>
